                     /note="Domain:cl00767:OsmC OsmC-like protein. pfam02566,
                     OsmC-like protein, contains several deeply split clades of
                     homologous proteins. The clade modeled here includes the
                     protein OsmC, or osmotically induced protein C. The member
                     from Thermus thermophilus was shown to have hydroperoxide
                     peroxidase activity. In many species, this protein is
